3498f1656482"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This is a tutorial notebook describing the usage of the MultivariateApart \
package. Our paper describes the underlying concepts and algorithms:\
\[LineSeparator]\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]MultivariateApart: Generalized Partial \
Fractions\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], Matthias Heller and Andreas von \
Manteuffel, ",
 ButtonBox["https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.08283",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.08283"], None},
  ButtonNote->"https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.08283"]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8372654760497913`*^9, 3.837265663309614*^9}, {
  3.83726570096996*^9, 3.837265710969881*^9}, {3.837268729789331*^9, 
  3.8372687463084707`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b11ab10e-d646-457b-9ed7-\
4f4a3c58b920"],

