Cell["\<\
Next, we show how to perform the polynomial reduction in our iterated scheme. \
We set the partition size to the heuristic value 1000.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8372697670274897`*^9, 3.837269939662779*^9}, {
  3.837270014352661*^9, 3.83727001505591*^9}, {3.83727615273529*^9, 
