Cell["\<\
Alternatively, the external program Form can be used to perform the iterated \
reduction.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.837275903539878*^9, 3.837276084701951*^9}, {
  3.837279710060362*^9, 3.837279722585471*^9}, {3.837279889595605*^9, 
